{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/rolling_dice.gif?t=1748896657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roll dice and magical trinkets and pair them with weapons to battle legendary monsters. Master the art of chance in a journey where every roll counts. Unlock new gear by completing grueling challenges and prepare for the final battle against the King of undead, the Lich!</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/enemies_attacking.gif?t=1748896657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dice Deck Builder</strong>: Carefully collect dice and trinkets that complement your fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dice: </strong>Regular dice are not enough, from dice that roll the best outcome all the way to dice that can predict the roll of other dice, your options are endlessly game-changing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trinkets: </strong>When dice are not enough, use trinkets to shift the outcome, from simply re-rolling a die to creating an army of ghost dice, you'd never run out of ways to manipulate the outcome of a battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapons</strong>: Each weapon has its own rules and risks, turning every attack into a unique puzzle of precision and luck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playable Characters: </strong>Every adventurer adds new abilities, no two journeys play the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player Abilities</strong>: Level up, select unique abilities, and elevate your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Monsters</strong>: Before facing the Lich, battle classic folklore creatures such as the Strigoi, Vetala, and many more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Journey</strong>: You will die many times, but every attempt will be unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meta Progression:</strong> Complete challenges to earn new gear and keep every new run feeling fresh.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/loot.gif?t=1748896657\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3415570?t=1748896657","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/6ee22cf4daba71dc70418f5f5f200ab98d08fce1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748896657","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/19f6784e556f644249479e99ae347737a59134ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748896657","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/19f6784e556f644249479e99ae347737a59134ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748896657","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/rolling_dice.gif?t=1748896657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roll dice and magical trinkets and pair them with weapons to battle legendary monsters. Master the art of chance in a journey where every roll counts. Unlock new gear by completing grueling challenges and prepare for the final battle against the King of undead, the Lich!</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/enemies_attacking.gif?t=1748896657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dice Deck Builder</strong>: Carefully collect dice and trinkets that complement your fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dice: </strong>Regular dice are not enough, from dice that roll the best outcome all the way to dice that can predict the roll of other dice, your options are endlessly game-changing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trinkets: </strong>When dice are not enough, use trinkets to shift the outcome, from simply re-rolling a die to creating an army of ghost dice, you'd never run out of ways to manipulate the outcome of a battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapons</strong>: Each weapon has its own rules and risks, turning every attack into a unique puzzle of precision and luck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playable Characters: </strong>Every adventurer adds new abilities, no two journeys play the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player Abilities</strong>: Level up, select unique abilities, and elevate your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Monsters</strong>: Before facing the Lich, battle classic folklore creatures such as the Strigoi, Vetala, and many more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Journey</strong>: You will die many times, but every attempt will be unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meta Progression:</strong> Complete challenges to earn new gear and keep every new run feeling fresh.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/loot.gif?t=1748896657\" /></p>","developers":["Monovoid"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/c2b0a56b4cbf0eb15ec5474bcedc3b99e28ed6a4/head